quiz.prompt:
The receiving card runs this program. The messages arrive in this order: nem = 50, nem = 28, sicak = 12, nem = 30. How many times is the sad face shown?

```
on radio received:
  if received name = "nem" then:
    set uzak to (received value)
    if uzak < 30 then:
      sad face and the Sad melody
    else:
      bar graph [uzak] up to [100]
```
